<title>CHINA: China says Taiwan at core of Sino-U.S. ties.</title>
<headline>China says Taiwan at core of Sino-U.S. ties.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Foreign Minister Qian Qichen said on Wednesday Taiwan was at the core of Sino-American relations and Beijing was looking toward the eventual ending of arms sales to the island.</p>
<p>&quot;The question of Taiwan is the core issue of Sino-American relations,&quot; Qian told reporters at the start of talks with U.S. Secretary of State Warren Christopher.</p>
</text>
